warning[bool_to_int_with_if]: a `bool` is turned into an integer with a branch
  --> tests/lint/bool_to_int_with_if/bad.jai:12:10
   |
12 |     a := ifx ready then 1 else 0;
   |          ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
help: write `cast(s64) ready`
   |
11
12 ~     a := cast(s64) ready;
13       b := ifx count > 3 then 0 else 1;
   |
   = note: see https://jacket.matteopolak.com/lint-rules/bool_to_int_with_if

warning[bool_to_int_with_if]: a `bool` is turned into an integer with a branch
